              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Indodana kaGeberi eRamoti kwaGileyadi; kuye kwakukhona imizi kaJayire indodana kaManase eseGileyadi; kuye kwakukhona isifunda sase-Arigobhi eseBashani, imizi emikhulu engamashumi ayisithupha enezindonga nemigoqo yethusi.",
          "type": "text",
