        {
          "text": "uGebere indodana ka-Uri wayesezweni lakwaGileyadi, ezweni likaSihon, ukumkani wama-Amori, nelika-Ogi inkosi yaseBashan; futhi kwakunguye yedwa isikhulu ezweni.",
