              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izinkomo eziyishumi ezikhuluphalisiweyo, nezinkomo ezingamashumi amabili zasemadlelweni, nemihlambi eyikhulu, ngaphandle kwezinyamazane, nezinyamazane, nezinyoni ezikhuluphalisiweyo.",
