        },
        {
          "text": "Wabusa phezu kwawo wonke umkhawulo ongasentshonalanga koMfula, kusukela eTifsa kuze kube se-Aza, phezu kwawo wonke amakhosi phesheya koMfula; waba nokuthula nxazonke zakhe.",
