              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OJuda no-Israyeli bahlala belondekile, kwaba yilowo nalowo phansi komvini wakhe naphansi komkhiwane wakhe, kusukela kwaDani kuze kube seBeri Sheba, zonke izinsuku zikaSolomoni.",
