              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngokuba wayehlakaniphe kunabo bonke abantu; njengo-Ethani umEzra, noHemani, noKalikoli, noDarda, amadodana kaMaholi; futhi umbiko wakhe wawuphakathi kwezizwe zonke nxazonke.",
          "type": "text",
