        {
          "text": "Wakhuluma ngemithi, kusukela kumsedari oseLebanoni kuze kufike kuhisopi elimila odongeni; wakhuluma nangezilwane, nezinyoni, nezilwanyana ezinwabuzelayo nezinhlanzi.",
          "type": "text",
